Not just any cartoonist, though. One of America's original underground cartoonists, Justin Green. My comic book, Pinky Brown, meets the Holy Virgin Mary. That's my best known work that I did as a young man. I can't seem to shake a little bastard. I got to see Justin speak last year at this fancy academic comic book conference in Chicago. And he gave me a book of his sign painting comics.
不过，他可不是普通的漫画家。他是美国原创地下漫画家之一，贾斯汀·格林。我的漫画书《平基·布朗遇见圣母玛利亚》，那是我年轻时最出名的作品。我似乎摆脱不了这个小混蛋。去年我在芝加哥参加一个高档的学术漫画会议时见到了贾斯汀，他给了我一本他的招牌绘画漫画。

