and craftsmanship of the items and services inside the store want to sign that embodies that quality and craftsmanship on the outside of the store. And back in San Francisco at New Bohemia signs, Scott Theson says business is booming. It seems in the past three or four years there's been a resurgence of especially designers really appreciating hand painted signage. You know, the way the letters flow on the brush, you can do slight things to make the lettering look a little bit better. I think just having something that's hand done,
